<title>HONG KONG: China Strategic interim net up 2.2 pct.</title>
<headline>China Strategic interim net up 2.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   20.62	 vs 22.28 (see note)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	   vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  130.41 gain vs 118.68 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    133.20	vs 130.28</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,823.82    vs 1,952.01</p>
<p>    Company name		 China Strategic Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - China Strategic is an investment holding company with restaurant and property subsidiaries.</p>
<p>Net is after exceptional gains from sales of its remaining interest in associates Ningbo Zhonghua Paper Co Ltd and MRI Holdings Ltd, and sale of its interest in certai car parking spaces in Hong Kong's Whampoa Garden.</p>
<p>Share earnings are based on a weighted average of 645.98 million shares vs 584.85 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
